NOTE ON SCOPE

This licence covers the source code of this rewrite only.

The game's text, item and character names, rank titles and overall design are
inherited from "Гопник v1.02" (V.P., 2003) and remain the property of the
original author. This project is an unofficial fan restoration.

The bitmap glyphs the game renders with are NOT distributed here: they are read
at startup from the user's own Windows installation (vga866.fon).
